  "apologética/Análisis de Doctrinas/La Biblia/The Bible, Weapon of Desperate.md": "## **The Bible, Weapon of Desperate** \\[[Folder](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B-9PnaxsQwDUcTdFbk9qUVBFXzg)/[Base](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JX0-bLHRY6ojpTJSAg0f_80A55M2F9ZTZAqrTrG0slM)\\] \\[ref, \\]\n\nArguing about the Bible and what it is; excluding from this analysis the meaning of the matter:\n\n1. **The Bible is a Weapon of Desperates**. Idea/Doctrine Description.  \n2. **The Bible is the Word of God**. If we assume that God is perfect He must provide his creation (a System) of a Guide/Tutorial/User Manual and the Bible is that perfect Manual.  \n   \n\n1. # **The Bible is a Weapon of Desperates**\n\n   1. ## **In favor**\n\n      1. ### **Verses**\n\n         1) # What about Melhola Saulo. [2nd Kings 6:23;](http://bible.com/1/2ki.6.23,%202) [2nd Kings 21:18](http://bible.com/1/2ki.21.18)\n\n            1) # **R:** \\<Rebuttal\\> \n\n         2) God made him against Israel ppl (2nd Kings 24:1) but : Satan made him against Israel ppl (1st Chronicles 21:1) So... how to decide than?  \n         3) Who was Maria's Husband and Father of Iosif? Jacob ([Mat 1:16](http://bible.com/1/mat.1.16)) Elijah ( [Luk 3:23](http://bible.com/1/luk.3.23))  \n            1) **R:** This is making reference to “the house” the descendance. [**son**](http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/son) 3\\. any male descendant: *a son of the Aztecs.*   \n            2)   \n            3) \n\n      2. ### **Ideas or metaphors**\n\n         1) 101 uncorrented moments  \n         2)   \n         3) \n\n   2. ## **Against**\n\n      1. ### **Verses**\n\n         1)   \n         2) \n\n      2. ### **Ideas or Metaphors**\n\n         1)   \n         2) \n\n2. # **The Bible is the Word of God**\n\n   1. ## **In favor**\n\n      1. ### **Verses** \n\n         1)   \n         2) \n\n      2. ### **Ideas or Metaphors**\n\n         1)   \n         2) \n\n   2. ## **Against**\n\n      1. ### **Verses**\n\n         1) If God is Perfect. He could do perfect things and creatures. Manual can be element of imperfection. Perfect stuff doesn't need any manual. It is Perfect from beginning to the end. If it is guidable and providable it means it doesn't have full base of knowledge of own behaviour. But maybe this stuff doesn't need it either. ANy manual and instruction can just confuse and make more problems. The serious question here is “What Perfection is...”  \n         2) The people can and has modified the Bible and the Manual should not be modified  \n         3) We need declaration what will satisfy life of all groups of ppl no care of his religion, social level, money etc   \n         4) n Ancient flying TransportWhere is the Proves that Bible is Word of God? Who can nowadays contact God and ask him this? Keisi could do it in the 20 ctntury. He was student of Christian School. And had Gift from Heaven. He could read mind, see Future and connect to Universe Knowledge Base as Nicola Tesla Could… some kind of Universal Internet Servers. He told about angels and demosn. He told about soul and reincornation. But what can we see in his speech? Maybe ANgels and Demons are High Advanced civilisations. If we talk about Islam \\- we can see that Muhamed gone to the Sky by the Green Beam on the winged Horse. WHat is it? Pegasis? I think NO… This is Anti-Gravitation Beam or Electromagnetic field. Nowadays scientists created laser what can push and pull things and stuff. About winged Horse \\- that could be some kind of Vivern()  \n            1) **R:** If this is making reference that we can’t Ask God in these days for the specification, If we assume that the Bible is that Manual the argument makes no sense due to the fact that the Bible specifies that God has approached to us several times, and it makes no difference to us. He rather leave the Book behind so everyone that wanted to ask can ask the Book if needed. He also provided it with some divine attributes that will back the book up.  \n         5)   \n         6) \n\n      2. ### **Ideas or Metaphors**\n\n         1) Check this on: https\\://www\\.youtube.com/watch?v=aUzlhMWYSTg  \n         2) \n\n",
